* This subsection describes file retrieve method which the O-DU8/NMS retrieves the file list from the
  * O-RU8. One or multiple files' information can be retrieved by one retrieve file list operation \(use of
  * wildcard is allowed\). The O-DU8/NMS triggers the retrieve file list operation from the O-RU8.
  * The following rpc is used for retrieve file list operation:
  * -rpc:retrieve-file-list
  * input
  * logical path: the logical path of files to be retrieved, wild-card is allowed;
  * file-name & file-name-filter: file name or file name filter, \* is the wild-card;
  * output
  * status: whether O-RU8 accepted or rejected the retrieve file list request;
  * reject-reason: the reason why O-RU8 rejects the request \(only applicable if status is rejected\);
  * file list: file list retrieved;
